{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/tilal-binghatti-binghatti-dubailand","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1423,"crm_id":"7666","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Tilal Binghatti","slug":"tilal-binghatti-binghatti-dubailand","display_address":"Dubailand","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Binghatti","price":4200000,"display_price":"4.2M","lattitude":25.122301779414,"longitude":55.433941788879,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Tilal Binghatti at Al Rowaiyah is an exceptional residential development located in the rapidly growing district of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand/\">Dubailand</a>. As Binghatti's first ever villa community, it offers <strong>4-bedroom villas</strong>, designed to provide the perfect balance of luxury and privacy. With a 10% down payment, the project presents an accessible entry into a high-potential investment, supported by strong capital appreciation driven by its strategic location and premium amenities.&nbsp;</p><p>The community’s latest launches, Tilal Oasis and Tilal Dunes, bring two distinct lifestyle concepts to the development. Tilal Oasis sits at the vibrant core of the community, surrounded by central green spaces, beachfront-inspired amenities, and social leisure destinations. Tilal Dunes offers a quieter residential atmosphere focused on privacy, greenery, wellness, and family-friendly outdoor living.</p><p>Tilal Binghatti by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-binghatti/\">Binghatti Developers</a> redefines modern living with its iconic architectural style. This collection of residences offers expansive floor plans, superior quality finishes, and an unrivaled suburban experience. With landscaped parks, a swimming pool, and dedicated fitness facilities, it provides a lifestyle of tranquility and convenience.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Tilal_Binghatti_at_Al_Rowaiyah_by_Binghatti_Developers_Luxury_Villas_in_Dubailand_1008d73ca0.jpg","hash":"Tilal_Binghatti_at_Al_Rowaiyah_by_Binghatti_Developers_Luxury_Villas_in_Dubailand_1008d73ca0","name":"Tilal Binghatti at Al Rowaiyah by Binghatti Developers | Luxury Villas in Dubailand"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Tilal_Binghatti_at_Al_Rowaiyah_by_Binghatti_Developers_Luxury_Villas_in_Dubailand_ba69a4d982.jpg","hash":"Tilal_Binghatti_at_Al_Rowaiyah_by_Binghatti_Developers_Luxury_Villas_in_Dubailand_ba69a4d982","name":"Tilal Binghatti at Al Rowaiyah by Binghatti Developers | Luxury Villas in Dubailand"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_9_044f31ff14.jpg","hash":"Gallery_9_044f31ff14","name":"Gallery-9.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_1_60e112e16f.jpg","hash":"Gallery_1_60e112e16f","name":"Gallery-1.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_5_2376ae9be6.jpg","hash":"Gallery_5_2376ae9be6","name":"Gallery-5.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_8_fdf3a5c86d.jpg","hash":"Gallery_8_fdf3a5c86d","name":"Gallery-8.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_2_21191917de.jpg","hash":"Gallery_2_21191917de","name":"Gallery-2.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_10_df439e1b52.jpg","hash":"Gallery_10_df439e1b52","name":"Gallery-10.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_4_6d111f269a.jpg","hash":"Gallery_4_6d111f269a","name":"Gallery-4.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazona