 a leader in luxury real estate.</li><li>Flexible Payment Plan – Structured on a 60/40 plan with just a 10% down payment, offering investors and end-users greater financial flexibility.</li><li>Starting Price – Villas at Tilal Binghatti start from AED 4.2M, presenting a compelling entry point into a premium gated villa community in Dubailand.</li><li>Capital Appreciation – Investors can expect strong value growth thanks to its prime location and Binghatti’s renowned architectural style.<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2088,"cta":null,"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Tilal_Binghatti_at_Al_Rowaiyah_by_Binghatti_Developers_Luxury_Villas_in_Dubailand_d45ba9766d.jpg","hash":"Tilal_Binghatti_at_Al_Rowaiyah_by_Binghatti_Developers_Luxury_Villas_in_Dubailand_d45ba9766d","name":"Tilal Binghatti at Al Rowaiyah by Binghatti Developers | Luxury Villas in Dubailand"},"style":null,"title":null,"heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[{"id":6,"place_name":"Academic City","time_distance":"5 Minutes"},{"id":7,"place_name":"Dubai Silicon Oasis","time_distance":"10 Minutes"},{"id":8,"place_name":"University of Dubai","time_distance":"12 Minutes"},{"id":9,"place_name":"Dubai Creek Harbour","time_distance":" 20 Minutes "},{"id":10,"place_name":"Dubai Design District","time_distance":"20 Minutes"},{"id":11,"place_name":"Business Bay","time_distance":"22 Minutes"},{"id":12,"place_name":"Downtown Dubai/Dubai Mall","time_distance":"24 Minutes"}],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":null,"design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4906,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":3547,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4712,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"4-Bedroom Villas","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"60/40","payment_plan